      "attribution_required": true,
      "claim_id": "body_3",
      "claim_kind": "NUMBER",
      "claim_text": "In its observed-source-fact layer, the report attributes a weekly injection of 67 Bcf to the retained EIA release, against a five-year same-week injection average of 90 Bcf. Stocks were 3,567 Bcf: 45 Bcf above the five-year stock average and 143 Bcf below the prior-year level. The stock comparisons describe different reference points; neither converts the refill comparison into a measured market surprise.",
